[{"speaker":"","text":"这时，蕾娜好像用尽了力气一样倒向了我。","art":{"background":"a3744","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"我从蕾娜背后接住她，然后沉浸在无法言喻的满足感中。","art":{"background":"a3744","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"这世界上有个能接受我的女孩子。","art":{"background":"a3744","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽然这样说有点夸张，但这让我强烈而明确地感受到我还活着。","art":{"background":"a3744","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"……因为这点事就感触良多，是因为我太单纯了吗？","art":{"background":"a3744","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是就在这时，蕾娜用力地握住了我的手。","art":{"background":"a3744","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「我爱你，将臣」","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊……」","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"只是，我突然明白，蕾娜心情其实也和我一样。","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"我十分确信。","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我也爱你，蕾娜」","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「……啾，呵呵～我知道的啦」","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"所以我们亲吻着对方，紧紧地抱在一起。","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"不一会儿，我们就甜甜地入睡了。","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"}]